; One level of an NGSI-LD scope path (ETSI GS CIM 009 v1.9.1, clause 4.18).
;
; Split out of `scope.abnf` so a scope *pattern*, whose wildcards are a query
; construct rather than a lexical one, can validate its labels against the same
; production the path itself is derived from instead of restating it by hand.

ScopeLevel      = unicodeLetter *ScopeLevelChar
ScopeLevelChar  = unicodeNumber / unicodeLetter / %x5F   ; _ (underscore)
